      "content": "it's just hard to see the point in any of it when you put it that way. like, if you're calling it \"logical\" to just stop resisting the quiet... then it doesn't even feel like a tragedy anymore. it just feels like an inevitable conclusion. is there really any reason to keep up the fight, or is that just something people tell themselves so they don't have to face the reality of it?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
